From abd52d0078dd898f1e3c9c9dad3ff56cea9022fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lcy <admin@luchenyang.xyz>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:05:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fingerprint: rothko FodEngine 2.0 lifecycle and screen-off
 wake

Adds an opt-in path for Xiaomi FodEngine 2.0 optical under-display
fingerprint sensors (rothko):

- fod/FodStateMachine and KeyguardDriverSessionBridge drive the vendor
  FOD monitor/lease commands for keyguard authentication, including the
  screen-off wake press and its prepared-press release.
- KeyguardScreenOffWakePolicy/KeyguardWakePolicyCore decide when a
  screen-off press may wake the device.
- UDFPS: optionally report UI_READY only after the illumination frame is
  committed (config_udfpsDeferUiReadyUntilFrameCommit), plus frame gate
  and UI event plumbing in SystemUI.
- ColorFade/DisplayPowerController and keyguard geometry adjustments used
  by the wake path; dumpsys fingerprint diagnostics counters.

Everything is gated by config_rothkoFodStateBridgeEnabled and
config_udfpsDeferUiReadyUntilFrameCommit, which default to false.
